cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Software accompanying the quadruped elevator interaction study"
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gholibqasobov/go2_autonomous_inspection"
abstract: >-
  ROS 2 Humble software used in the real-world experiments of the study
  "Autonomous Elevator Interaction and Multi-Floor Navigation for Quadruped
  Robots Using Vision and Fiducial-Guided Manipulation". It runs the
  elevator task on a Unitree Go2 Edu quadruped carrying a RoArm-M2-S
  manipulator and an Intel RealSense D435 camera: AprilTag-based docking at
  the lobby and in-cabin panels, fiducial-guided button pressing with
  panel geometry measured offline, cabin entry, floor selection, and
  elevator exit. The source code is identical to commit
  358d90c750cbb3dd9732ec7f98b26e73ab07b1ec, the version used for the five
  reported elevator trials; this release only adds documentation, the
  license file and citation metadata.
keywords:
  - quadruped robot
  - elevator interaction
  - multi-floor navigation
  - fiducial markers
  - mobile manipulation
  - ROS 2
